# Cloudflare Pages headers of the Flutter PWA (Pages project te-tengo-app,
# https://app.tetengo.reqsai.tech). Reference copy: the PWA is now built and deployed by the release
# pipeline of te-tengo-mobile-flutter, which must ship these files in its build output (build/web);
# no workflow of this repository uses them. Flutter and Firebase need their own policy, so the landing's CSP,
# COOP and Permissions-Policy are not applied here.
# File names are not hashed and the app's own service worker (firebase-messaging-sw.js, scope /)
# caches network first, so everything revalidates.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# Flutter's deprecated worker is emitted but never registered (te-tengo-mobile-flutter
# docs/WEB_PWA.md); never let a browser keep a stale copy.
/flutter_service_worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-store
